==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|producere|prōdūcere|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|produco|prōdūcō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-produire.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/pʁɔ.dɥiʁ/|lang=fr}}, {{X-SAMPA|/pRO.dHiR/}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{transitive}} to [[produce]], to [[yield]]
# {{reflexive}} to [[happen]], [[take place]] (of an event)
# {{reflexive}} to [[perform]] (of a singer etc.)

====Synonyms====
* [[causer]]
* [[fournir]]
* [[provoquer]]

====Related terms====
* [[producteur]]/[[productrice]]
* [[productible]]
* [[productif]]/[[productive]]
* [[production]]
* [[produit]]
* [[reproduire]]

